    "body": "The CSP spec only distinguishes between `\"style\"` and anything but style. In this PR you use `\"style attribute\"`, `\"style\"`, `\"script\"`, and `\"script attribute\"`. Is it intentional that script-src is used for \"style attribute\"? If so maybe add a Note in the CSP spec would be good...\n",
