    "body": "\"style attribute\" shows up in https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#match-element-to-source-list and https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#style-src-algorithms. \"script attribute\" in https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#match-element-to-source-list and https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#script-src-algorithms.\n\nI don't think `script-src` is used for \"`style attribute`\", but I'm happy to correct any errors I've made in the spec. There was a lot of copy/pasting.\n",
