    "body": "https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#should-block-inline says \"`\"style-src\"` if type is `\"style\"` and `\"script-src\"` otherwise,\" so `\"style attribute\"` will use `\"script-src\"`, I believe.\n\nIn general, is there value in differentiating between \"script\" and \"script attribute\" and the same for style?\n",
