    "body": "Yes. There are distinctions in behavior between attributes on elements and the elements themselves. For instance, nonces can apply to inline scripts and style, but do not apply to inline event handlers or `style` attributes.\n\nThanks for the heads up with the algorithm: updated in https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-csp/commit/96f37a90276126cb2ad5dbe845585dc3655473ce.\n",
